###########################################################################################################
# CLASS FLUFF DESCRIPTION
###########################################################################################################
warrior_desc_fluff = "A seasoned adventurer who values \^00FFFFbrawn\^^ and \^00FFFFcandor\^^ over cunning. He lives for duels and cutting down the biggest, baddest monster in the room, but under all the bravado, there is a soft heart that always makes sure to \^00FFFFprotect\^^ his teammates from harm."

rogue_desc_fluff = "Mistress of the bow and guile. Prefers \^00FFFFlong range\^^ combat, \^00FFFFtraps\^^ and \^00FFFFspeed\^^ over brute force. She can \^00FFFFstun\^^ with her razor-sharp humor and the purse she just snatched from your belt alike."

mage_desc_fluff = "They say the study of \^00FFFFpowerful\^^ arcane magic that can incinerate an entire \^00FFFFarea\^^ of monsters opens the doors to insanity. Maybe his wit is a sign of this, maybe it's a coping mechanism. Or maybe both. Wizards always \^00FFFFtread a narrow path\^^."

tinkerer_desc_fluff = "Alumnus of the same university as the Mage, engineering department. \^00FFFFSupportive\^^ even if looking down at magic as an \"easy way out\". Strongly believes in careful \^00FFFFplanning\^^ and \^00FFFFbuilding up\^^ solutions until they do the whole work for him. Has a soft spot for \^00FFFFalliterations\^^."

bruja_desc_fluff = "A mysterious witch, threading the needle between \^00FFFFpowerful blood magic\^^ and \^00FFFFdemonic reckoning\^^. She can heal and harm in powerful ways but with great power comes a twisted price."


